# "uat" used to be here. It was added incidentally in 3e5a804, whose only other
# change was to lib/object/object.go, and nothing builds an artefact by that
# name -- but it matched the uat/ directory, so every OCI test case written
# under uat/oci was silently untracked and invisible to review.
